      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok so you mentioned the islamic golden age and china and stuff, but when you say the greeks and europeans were the \"pinnacle,\" do you mean they were objectively more advanced or just that they had more influence on the specific way we do things today? i'm trying to understand if you think one way of doing science or law is \"better\" or more \"civilized\" than others.",
